          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>At Zenith Sports, excellence is more than a goal—it’s a standard we live by every day. We understand that youth soccer is not just about competition; it’s about growth, discipline, and joy. Our TEKKY™ ball is carefully engineered to challenge young players, encouraging precision, control, and confidence with every practice. By combining innovation with passion, we aim to set a new benchmark in youth soccer development and help build the next generation of champions.</p>"
