            "image": "shopify://shop_images/c1.jpg",
            "title": "Skill-First Approach",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p>At Zenith Sports, we believe technical skill is the foundation of greatness. Our training tools and philosophy focus on developing touch, control, and decision-making—helping players rise above a “kick and run” mentality.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": ""
