            "title": "Designed for Development",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p>The TEKKY™ ball is engineered to challenge and inspire. With its smaller size and increased weight, it builds strength and precision in every session—transforming simple drills into impactful development.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": ""
          }
