          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "From the Founders",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_mBHdV7": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>I was born and raised in Denmark in a soccer family, where the game was a part of everyday life. That passion led to a 16-year professional career, taking me from Denmark to clubs across Europe, Asia, and North America. Soccer gave me incredible experiences, life lessons, and a deep respect for the different ways the game is played and taught around the world. As my playing career wound down, I became increasingly passionate about youth coaching. Over the past six years, that passion has turned into a mission: to help the next generation of players grow. I have seen the potential in young athletes - especially in the U.S. but also the need for a more creative, player-driven development model. That is why we created TEKKY™. It is more than just a product - it is a movement to inspire kids to enjoy the process of improvement, build confidence, and fall in love with the game. This is not just about training. It is about building a culture.  </p>"
          }
        },
        "subheading_bYGxai": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>– Philip Lund</strong>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_LxQpwP",
