    "image_with_text_Um7pVL": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_BE9Kz7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "From the Founders",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_BXKQT9": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>With over 40 years in the game, from collegiate play through to post-collegiate competition, my experience spans every level of the sport. I’ve spent extensive years coaching, always with a clear focus on true player development—not just winning games. I’m passionate about youth development and deeply committed to fostering intelligent, technical players, but I find a growing misalignment between the current U.S. player development roadmap and the outcomes we claim to want at the highest levels. My approach remains rooted in long-term growth over short-term accolades, aiming to bridge that gap for the next generation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "subheading_dCeV3j": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>– Paul Hanson</strong>"
          }
        }
      },
